  "dialogue": [
    {
      "id": "warm_cup",
      "start": 24.0,
      "end": 27.2,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Here. While it\u2019s warm."
    },
    {
      "id": "thanks",
      "start": 28.2,
      "end": 30.8,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "Thanks, Mira"
    },
    {
      "id": "shaking_hands",
      "start": 31.8,
      "end": 36.1,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Your hands are still shaking. Mine too."
    },
    {
      "id": "hands_will_stop",
      "start": 37.1,
      "end": 42.3,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "It'll be ok, they'll stop once we get moving."
    },
    {
      "id": "miras_hands",
      "start": 43.3,
      "end": 46.5,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "I hope you're right."
    },
    {
      "id": "entrance",
      "start": 47.5,
      "end": 51.0,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "How far to the entrance?"
    },
    {
      "id": "ridge",
      "start": 52.0,
      "end": 56.3,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Beyond the ridge. There\u2019s some climbing yet."
    },
    {
      "id": "can_manage",
      "start": 57.3,
      "end": 60.1,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "I can manage."
    },
    {
      "id": "rest",
      "start": 61.1,
      "end": 66.5,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "I know. But you need to rest a bit first."
    },
    {
      "id": "valley_houses",
      "start": 67.5,
      "end": 72.7,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "You know, there are still people in those houses."
    },
    {
      "id": "evacuation",
      "start": 73.7,
      "end": 82.0,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Yeah...but the caravan is going back for another group. They will make it out...I hope."
    },
    {
      "id": "opposite_direction",
      "start": 83.0,
      "end": 92.0,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "And when we leave here, we\u2019re going the other way. It feels like we're turning our back on them."
    },
    {
      "id": "surge",
      "start": 93.0,
      "end": 104.6,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Maybe...but another surge like that could wipe out the whole valley. We need to reach the source so we can put an end to this."
    },
    {
      "id": "promise",
      "start": 105.6,
      "end": 113.6,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "I'm scared, Mira. We've come so far, but we still have so far left to go."
    },
    {
      "id": "first_carts",
      "start": 114.6,
      "end": 120.7,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "It's ok, Caelan, I'm scared too. But I believe in you!"
    },
    {
      "id": "mill_memory",
      "start": 121.7,
      "end": 126.1,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "Mira...I was thinking about the mill."
    },
    {
      "id": "halden",
      "start": 127.1,
      "end": 129.7,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Halden\u2019s?"
    },
    {
      "id": "small_spell",
      "start": 130.7,
      "end": 143.0,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "Do you remember when I barely managed to clear that little recess? Would you ever have guessed we'd look back on that as the least of our troubles?"
    },
    {
      "id": "useful_spell",
      "start": 144.0,
      "end": 150.4,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "*laughs* Ha...yeah that seems like a lifetime ago now. But, Caelan?"
    },
    {
      "id": "told_me",
      "start": 151.4,
      "end": 154.0,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "id": "meant_it",
      "start": 155.0,
      "end": 164.6,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "I know what else you're thinking about. I want you to know he's just as proud of you as I am."
    },
    {
      "id": "nervous",
      "start": 167.7,
      "end": 171.5,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "...thanks. I'm feeling better...lighter."
    },
    {
      "id": "understood_problem",
      "start": 174.05,
      "end": 178.85,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Your hands stopped shaking. Mine too...I'm ready."
    },
    {
      "id": "catch_and_branch",
      "start": 179.85,
      "end": 187.85,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "This lamp...we'll leave it here. Mira, think you can you work your magic with it?"
    },
    {
      "id": "two_of_us",
      "start": 188.85,
      "end": 195.05,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Leave it to me! This beacon will guide the evacuation to safety."
    },
    {
      "id": "simple_again",
      "start": 196.05,
      "end": 199.25,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "This should help too."
    },
    {
      "id": "so_do_i",
      "start": 212.35,
      "end": 216.65,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "Ok there! Don't break on me now."
    },
    {
      "id": "going_in",
      "start": 217.65,
      "end": 221.15,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "Huh? Me? Or the lamp?"
    },
    {
      "id": "when_ready",
      "start": 222.15,
      "end": 224.95,
      "speaker": "Mira",
      "text": "*smiles* Let's go."
    },
    {
      "id": "one_moment",
      "start": 225.95,
      "end": 228.55,
      "speaker": "Caelan",
      "text": "Indeed."
    }
  ],
